* annex.backend=MD5E
**/.git* annex.largefiles=nothing

# Only data/ledger/** goes through git-annex (B2). Everything else -- code,
# README, config, tests -- stays plain git text, always readable/diffable
# without `datalad get`. This is the "large EDN shard -> annex" split
# CLAUDE.md's large-binary-datalad policy calls for: a single tick's
# ledger file can be tens of MB (measured 2026-08-28: 120,000 domains ->
# 158MB, over GitHub's 100MB hard limit and rejected on push), and this
# repeats every tick for as long as the resident runs -- committing that
# directly as plain git blobs would make .git itself the thing growing
# unbounded, not just one file.
* annex.largefiles=nothing
data/ledger/** annex.largefiles=anything
